cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ORCA in your research, please cite the SBCCI 2026 paper below."
type: software
title: "ORCA: Open RF Integrated Circuit Automation"
abstract: >-
  ORCA is an open-source, AI-assisted pipeline for building neural network
  surrogate models of RF integrated circuit passives. It generates parametric
  GDS layouts with gdsfactory, runs full-wave electromagnetic simulations with
  Palace, trains a PyTorch model to predict S-parameters and exports it to ONNX
  for fast circuit-level optimization with COBRA.
